abstract: >-
  Versioned evidence package accompanying a working paper on intuition as hypothesis generation, behavioral anomaly detection, and the attempted falsification of a proposed space-weather explanation. The package contains article versions, extracted behavioral data, evidence provenance, methods, references, and figures. It does not establish or claim a causal biological effect of space weather.
